WEBVTT

00:01.950 --> 00:06.010
Onee-chan will definitely come back for me.

00:06.730 --> 00:09.320
There will be no one coming back.

00:09.320 --> 00:13.770
Then Onee-chan will tell me that she loves me.

00:13.770 --> 00:16.580
There will be no one to love you.

00:16.580 --> 00:19.190
You will not be loved by anyone.

00:19.190 --> 00:23.400
I’m sure that’s not true…

00:24.020 --> 00:27.790
Priestess of the Darkness, your power is depriving the world of light.

00:28.150 --> 00:30.950
Bury the light in deep darkness.

00:30.950 --> 00:37.140
If I do that, Onee-chan will return to me?

00:52.360 --> 00:54.900
kimi to ireba

00:52.360 --> 00:54.900
If I’m with you -

00:54.900 --> 00:57.740
kimi to itara

00:54.900 --> 00:57.740
because I’m with you -

00:57.740 --> 01:02.370
kokoro ga yasuraku

00:57.740 --> 01:02.370
my heart is at ease.

01:03.330 --> 01:05.920
kimi mo soude

01:03.330 --> 01:05.920
Surely, you’re the same.

01:05.920 --> 01:11.460
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:05.920 --> 01:11.460
You’re at ease now, too.

01:12.510 --> 01:19.100
itekuretara ii noni

01:12.510 --> 01:19.100
If you can just admit it,

01:20.850 --> 01:24.430
sono mama

01:20.850 --> 01:24.430
for even time to forget us,

01:25.270 --> 01:38.570
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

01:25.270 --> 01:38.570
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:39.320 --> 01:50.040
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:39.320 --> 01:50.040
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

01:50.040 --> 01:56.920
chiisana yume egaite yukou

01:50.040 --> 01:56.920
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

01:56.920 --> 02:02.850
futaride sasayaka na

01:56.920 --> 02:02.850
And just like that, we are happy

02:04.270 --> 02:08.480
kotoba ga ureshii

02:04.270 --> 02:08.480
over such trifling words

02:08.980 --> 02:13.190
somatteku sora

02:08.980 --> 02:13.190
that paint the sky.

02:31.080 --> 02:35.130
Loving Hearts

02:38.320 --> 02:42.600
Thank you for finding my sister. I love you!

02:43.270 --> 02:46.310
Say, what’s your relationship with Miyamori?

02:47.700 --> 02:48.560
We’re friends.

02:50.860 --> 02:52.310
Friends.

02:59.080 --> 03:03.690
Be it Priestess or Sedona, they are all lies.

03:06.500 --> 03:08.250
As if...

03:09.160 --> 03:12.290
I will always be Kanon-chan’s friend.

03:12.710 --> 03:16.050
You’re no different from them!
You’ll eventually leave me behind, too!

03:16.860 --> 03:18.090
Kanon-chan!

03:19.300 --> 03:24.110
I thought I was already used to people distancing themselves from me,

03:24.110 --> 03:25.810
but I’m lonely.

03:26.690 --> 03:31.260
Before I knew it, I somehow became attached to Marin.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.270
Marin!

03:45.860 --> 03:47.120
Priestess of the Sky.

03:50.130 --> 03:52.000
Where’s Urin? What happened?

03:53.830 --> 03:56.380
Kanon-chan, I’m sorry.

03:58.150 --> 04:01.420
I’m sorry for saying cruel things to you.

04:02.570 --> 04:03.760
No, it’s nothing.

04:03.760 --> 04:06.050
I wasn’t that bothered by it.

04:06.050 --> 04:08.980
I still cannot become a priestess,

04:08.980 --> 04:11.850
but I want to quickly save Urin…

04:11.850 --> 04:13.850
What should I do now?

04:14.440 --> 04:16.560
Please, Kanon-chan.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.860
Teach me how to become a priestess.

04:19.650 --> 04:21.490
I don’t know how to do that either.

04:25.600 --> 04:27.160
Kanon-chan, please!

04:28.480 --> 04:32.670
Please help us…

04:34.400 --> 04:36.140
Even if you say so…

04:36.140 --> 04:42.090
What we need is your power - you, who can transform into a priestess even though you have a dark heart.

04:42.090 --> 04:47.470
You two must cooperate and transform into priestesses together!

04:58.250 --> 04:59.600
Got it.

04:59.600 --> 05:00.860
We’ll figure it out together.

05:02.820 --> 05:05.320
Thank you, Kanon-chan!

05:06.750 --> 05:10.450
Listen up. I won’t be helping you this time.

05:10.450 --> 05:13.200
It’s not like you’ve helped with anything before!

05:16.930 --> 05:21.000
Now that I think about it, why did you lose your priestess powers?

05:22.010 --> 05:24.770
Maybe because of what happened during the solar eclipse.

05:24.770 --> 05:26.120
That makes sense…

05:26.120 --> 05:30.640
But when I listened to the island song, I was able to transform…

05:31.860 --> 05:33.310
I’ll wash your back.

05:33.620 --> 05:35.770
Ever since the solar eclipse,

05:36.110 --> 05:41.440
I've felt like there are worries and unhappiness within my heart. It's so painful.

05:41.910 --> 05:44.600
For starters, I think we should calm you down.

05:45.530 --> 05:47.610
Daily Store Suzuki

05:46.250 --> 05:48.240
Miyamori, what’s up?

05:48.240 --> 05:50.980
Suzuki, you did yoga before, right?

05:50.980 --> 05:52.330
Eh, yeah…

05:52.740 --> 05:57.750
Is there any method to calm and lighten your heart?

05:59.340 --> 06:01.920
There are some…

06:04.670 --> 06:06.800
This is the “standing tree” pose.

06:06.800 --> 06:10.750
It helps to raise your concentration and increase stamina.

06:10.750 --> 06:13.520
Loosen up for a bit. Just relax when you do it.

06:13.520 --> 06:14.470
’Kay.

06:15.110 --> 06:16.540
Easier said than done…

06:17.630 --> 06:19.350
Next is the “eagle” pose.

06:19.350 --> 06:20.690
It raises your motivation.

06:21.110 --> 06:24.000
Wrap your left leg around your right leg.

06:24.000 --> 06:27.610
Keep your hands in front and bend over your knees.

06:30.630 --> 06:31.920
The “bow” pose.

06:31.930 --> 06:34.910
This pose gets rid of irritation and nervousness.

06:33.200 --> 06:34.910
Irritation

06:36.330 --> 06:37.580
Kanon-chan.

06:38.150 --> 06:42.620
Honestly, you get so serious when it comes to helping people.

06:42.620 --> 06:46.260
Don’t say embarrassing things. Besides, it’s not even true.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.380
Especially if it concerns you.

06:48.430 --> 06:49.380
S-Stop it!

06:50.590 --> 06:51.760
Kanon-chan…

06:51.760 --> 06:53.260
I’m evil, you know.

06:53.660 --> 06:54.930
When she was in kindergarten, you see…

06:54.930 --> 06:55.680
I told you to stop!

06:56.290 --> 06:59.220
Nobody wanted to play with Miyamori.

06:59.220 --> 07:02.350
Play wiff me!

07:10.310 --> 07:11.200
Wipe your face.

07:16.360 --> 07:19.400
Kanon-chan, you’re not as scary as I thought.

07:19.400 --> 07:20.130
Huh?

07:20.130 --> 07:23.130
You came to play with everyone?

07:23.780 --> 07:24.590
It’s not like that…

07:25.720 --> 07:29.570
Everyone, don’t play with Kanon-chan.

07:29.570 --> 07:30.630
Why not?

07:30.840 --> 07:32.840
Because her evil will infect you!

07:32.840 --> 07:36.940
Scary. What is evil? I don’t know, but it sounds scary.

07:36.940 --> 07:38.850
That’s not true.

07:39.170 --> 07:42.360
Don’t! Are you okay with becoming evil?

07:42.360 --> 07:43.520
What are you making?

07:44.100 --> 07:45.010
Mud dango.

07:46.170 --> 07:47.320
That was made from mud?

07:50.340 --> 07:54.740
Anyone who touches this will be cursed!

07:53.200 --> 07:58.160
Just to make sure I wouldn’t be excluded because I was friends with her, she did that to the others.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.700
That’s not it!

08:01.120 --> 08:03.710
Suzuki, you’re babbling too much!

08:03.960 --> 08:06.420
But I’m happy, you know.

08:06.420 --> 08:10.280
For Miyamori to actually ask me to help…

08:10.280 --> 08:11.720
This is a first, right?

08:12.680 --> 08:16.510
This must mean Miyamori is all over you, huh?

08:16.510 --> 08:18.570
That’s enough! Hurry up and teach us yoga!

08:18.570 --> 08:19.720
Kanon-chan…

08:19.720 --> 08:21.560
What? What’s the next pose?

08:22.040 --> 08:24.740
Then, let’s try “chair” pose.

08:24.740 --> 08:26.520
Whatever, let’s do it!

08:32.830 --> 08:36.880
Somehow, the tides are becoming weird, so we can’t do any swimming now.

08:36.880 --> 08:39.410
I don’t believe this. Just when we finally got here.

08:41.150 --> 08:43.540
I don’t think we should go any closer…

08:45.710 --> 08:47.840
How is it, Kanon-chan?

08:48.200 --> 08:51.510
The “chair” pose doesn’t seem to have any effect either.

08:52.120 --> 08:55.880
I think it’ll be better if we just shout ourselves out.

08:57.150 --> 08:59.090
We’re transforming!

08:59.090 --> 09:00.580
Are you a school kid?

09:01.530 --> 09:02.490
Ooshima, where?

09:02.490 --> 09:06.100
Then again, even they don’t say things like “we’re transforming” nowadays.

09:06.740 --> 09:10.070
Forget about being a middle-schooler - you fail as a human!

09:10.470 --> 09:14.340
What are you doing there? Your clothes will get drenched.

09:14.720 --> 09:19.370
Leave me alone. Looking at these dark clouds calms me down.

09:20.000 --> 09:20.780
Ooshima…

09:21.320 --> 09:24.960
I told Kojima that you are all right.

09:25.830 --> 09:26.920
Thanks.

09:27.440 --> 09:32.680
And I even told him “since she’s okay, don’t send me any mails anymore!” or something like that.

09:32.680 --> 09:33.940
Is that so?

09:34.500 --> 09:40.070
Jeez, I already about know your plan to make him contact you out of worry only to hang up on him…

09:40.070 --> 09:41.440
No, I don’t really…

09:41.440 --> 09:43.770
Jeez, how long–

09:47.080 --> 09:48.940
Are you all right? Your head…

09:48.940 --> 09:52.860
I did what you said?!

09:50.900 --> 09:52.860
She did a lot of things, though.

09:53.670 --> 09:56.200
Jeez, this annoys me!

09:58.070 --> 09:58.860
I will say this, though.

10:01.030 --> 10:04.170
I properly confessed.

10:05.910 --> 10:08.460
Give up your half-assed attitude

10:08.460 --> 10:10.710
and face me directly.

10:12.020 --> 10:14.920
That is, if you really like Kojima-kun.

10:16.900 --> 10:19.900
Attack with your evil aura unleashed

10:19.900 --> 10:22.340
and finish me off in style!

10:24.170 --> 10:27.670
That embarrassing transforming girl is better off dead!

10:27.670 --> 10:30.350
Why did she say such horrible things?

10:30.350 --> 10:34.680
Because Ooshima really likes Kojima-kun.

10:35.590 --> 10:37.260
Because she likes him?

10:39.250 --> 10:43.060
I’m not any different, either.

10:43.760 --> 10:48.620
Be it Ooshima or Kojima, I’ve done terrible things to them.

10:49.170 --> 10:52.710
It’s just as Ooshima said. I’ve been half-assing things.

10:54.170 --> 10:56.000
Yeah, so have I…

10:56.590 --> 10:58.670
Kanon-chan would never understand.

10:59.540 --> 11:03.270
It was Kanon-chan’s ring in the first place, right?

11:03.670 --> 11:05.680
If only that damn ring didn’t exist…

11:06.760 --> 11:09.850
I said something horrible to Kanon-chan.

11:10.870 --> 11:15.020
It seems that we’re both confused.

11:16.390 --> 11:18.750
Even when I’m being depended on, too…

11:18.750 --> 11:19.900
Sorry.

11:19.900 --> 11:22.230
No, I should be the one apologizing.

11:22.860 --> 11:24.990
Kanon-chan is already suffering.

11:24.990 --> 11:26.210
Sorry.

11:26.810 --> 11:29.610
Is it really painful for me?

11:29.610 --> 11:32.530
I’m not really sure about that.

11:32.530 --> 11:35.390
You like Kojima-san, right?

11:35.850 --> 11:39.160
This is bad. It’s just as Ooshima said.

11:39.620 --> 11:42.380
Looking at the sea calms your heart.

11:44.500 --> 11:47.190
Let’s split up and act independently, just for a little while.

11:48.460 --> 11:52.100
Since we’re together, we can’t really put much thought into this.

12:05.970 --> 12:08.490
I won’t be able to see Marin’s smile for some time.

12:09.490 --> 12:13.330
We’ll definitely save Urin, no matter what it takes.

12:25.800 --> 12:28.750
Eh? You’re definitely the one who was close to Miyamori.

12:28.750 --> 12:30.170
I’m Marin.

12:30.170 --> 12:31.770
I’m Kojima.

12:32.380 --> 12:36.070
Miyamori isn’t at home now… Do you know where she is?

12:36.070 --> 12:39.660
If you’re looking for Kanon-chan, she’s currently alone, sorting out her thoughts.

12:39.660 --> 12:41.320
Sorting out her thoughts?

12:42.860 --> 12:47.030
It seems that you know the parts of Miyamori I never knew.

12:48.630 --> 12:50.320
That’s not true.

12:50.320 --> 12:52.820
It should be me who wants to know more

12:52.820 --> 12:54.540
about Kanon-chan.

12:57.190 --> 13:01.630
I don’t think I know that much about Miyamori, though.

13:02.450 --> 13:04.930
Weren’t you her boyfriend from the start?

13:06.330 --> 13:11.560
The first time we met was just after I moved to this island.

13:12.260 --> 13:16.600
It was when I got so lost that I couldn't find my way home.

13:17.090 --> 13:19.850
Eh? This is strange.

13:19.850 --> 13:25.570
Ah, hey! Sorry to bother you, but where is my home?

13:25.570 --> 13:26.610
Huh?

13:26.970 --> 13:31.050
There’s an address written in the memo, but…

13:31.050 --> 13:33.600
Ah, that’s not it. I just moved here.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.080
I know.

13:35.660 --> 13:38.040
I heard your introduction in the classroom today.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.920
Why is she angry?

13:39.880 --> 13:40.920
I’m sorry.

13:41.300 --> 13:42.960
Why are you apologizing?

13:42.960 --> 13:45.450
Just because. Sorry.

13:45.450 --> 13:46.430
Again.

13:46.430 --> 13:52.030
At that time, despite her appearance, she showed me the way home.

13:53.330 --> 13:54.470
Good morning!

13:54.980 --> 13:56.270
Good morning!

13:58.140 --> 14:00.250
Thank you for yesterday!

14:00.250 --> 14:01.640
It’s nothing.

14:01.640 --> 14:05.990
Speaking of which, you seemed to be in a hurry yesterday. Were you all right?

14:06.700 --> 14:08.240
I was in a hurry.

14:08.240 --> 14:11.530
I was late for work, and got my pay cut.

14:13.120 --> 14:14.410
Sorry.

14:14.410 --> 14:15.910
I’m truly sorry!

14:15.910 --> 14:18.250
I’m really sorry!

14:20.480 --> 14:23.550
Since then, it’s always been like that.

14:24.160 --> 14:27.720
I wondered why she was trying to avoid me.

14:28.140 --> 14:37.020
I found out she was always alone, avoiding everyone except me, too.

14:37.930 --> 14:41.020
I was concerned about her being so alone.

14:42.100 --> 14:44.270
Why are you always looking at me?

14:44.270 --> 14:46.150
Shouldn’t you return home?

14:46.150 --> 14:48.590
Miyamori, aren’t you going home?

14:48.590 --> 14:50.860
Since we are going to do a ghost house,

14:50.860 --> 14:53.240
the scarier the better, right?

14:53.240 --> 14:55.520
I’ll be the one who wears this, anyway.

14:55.520 --> 14:56.660
Gimme.

14:59.970 --> 15:02.930
How does it look with this?

15:02.930 --> 15:04.490
I wonder…

15:04.490 --> 15:06.600
Kojima, your hand will be dirty.

15:06.600 --> 15:09.260
Don’t you think you’re treating me like a kid?

15:10.190 --> 15:13.400
Says the guy who doesn’t know where his home is.

15:15.040 --> 15:17.340
That’s very harsh, you know…

15:22.900 --> 15:26.360
Eh? So, this is how you laugh.

15:26.700 --> 15:28.280
I wasn’t laughing.

15:29.830 --> 15:35.120
You can smile this nicely too, despite all that acting cold, huh.

15:35.880 --> 15:40.000
That was the first time anyone said that to me.

15:40.890 --> 15:47.030
And then, I somehow dropped my guard with Kojima-kun.

15:48.430 --> 15:51.880
Even though my heart said it was dangerous to do that…

15:52.340 --> 15:54.490
Why would I be frightened?

15:54.490 --> 15:56.890
I’m facing such beautiful eyes.

15:57.300 --> 15:58.930
It’s the same when I’m with Marin.

15:58.930 --> 16:00.560
I won’t let go.

16:01.360 --> 16:04.480
I will always be Kanon-chan’s friend.

16:05.570 --> 16:08.190
I realized that having such a relationship is dangerous.

16:10.310 --> 16:16.070
If we grow too close, when we part, it will definitely hurt.

16:18.470 --> 16:22.460
I gradually began to like her.

16:22.940 --> 16:26.540
As I was saying, I like you, Miyamori!

16:26.540 --> 16:28.900
Hold on, what are you saying all of a sudden?

16:28.900 --> 16:32.880
Ah, sorry, but I really mean it.

16:32.880 --> 16:37.800
Collection of Proverbs on Happiness

16:33.430 --> 16:39.720
Both the evil fortuneteller and the girl who reads a book like that… I like them both!

16:41.820 --> 16:43.190
You like weird things, huh…

16:43.570 --> 16:45.760
As I thought. Kojima has changed.

16:45.760 --> 16:47.950
He confessed to Miyamori.

16:47.950 --> 16:49.400
In the library, too!

16:49.670 --> 16:51.200
Unbelievable!

16:51.200 --> 16:51.940
Is that so?

16:53.030 --> 16:57.320
Such a wonderful confession… I would like to receive one.

17:00.050 --> 17:04.120
But the more I love him, the more I get worried…

17:05.650 --> 17:08.720
After a while, things became different.

17:09.490 --> 17:12.840
I don’t really care, even if you dump me.

17:17.920 --> 17:20.690
I was quite depressed then.

17:20.690 --> 17:24.780
But Kojima-san still likes Kanon-chan right now, right?

17:24.780 --> 17:28.910
The island song… You heard it, right?

17:28.910 --> 17:31.860
Yes, it’s a beautiful song.

17:31.860 --> 17:33.820
Do you understand the meaning behind it?

17:34.270 --> 17:34.610
No.

17:37.450 --> 17:45.040
The coming light

17:45.780 --> 17:52.130
beams down gracefully

17:53.130 --> 17:59.640
from behind.

18:00.870 --> 18:07.060
Shadow is born.

18:08.700 --> 18:16.320
Our wishes now

18:12.120 --> 18:21.870
This song is about overcoming farewells and sadness.
It is continuously sung in the hearts of the people of this island.

18:16.320 --> 18:22.830
turn them to light.

18:24.030 --> 18:28.330
If you make light from fire, shadow will be born behind you.

18:29.490 --> 18:34.800
Just as smiles exist in the light,
deep sadness lurks in the shadows.

18:37.480 --> 18:41.510
The shadow will disappear along with the light.

18:41.790 --> 18:43.810
I am alone.

18:44.680 --> 18:47.310
The parting… Whose fault is it?

18:48.720 --> 18:51.560
Whose fault is the parting?

18:52.540 --> 18:56.780
Who? Who is it that made us like this?

18:57.240 --> 18:58.500
This is cruel.

18:58.500 --> 19:00.600
Return Urin to me.

19:00.600 --> 19:01.800
Who?

19:01.800 --> 19:04.720
Unforgivable.

19:04.720 --> 19:06.450
This is unforgivable.

19:07.170 --> 19:10.610
The Sea and the Sky are different,

19:10.610 --> 19:13.170
yet they’re never apart.

19:16.560 --> 19:19.840
At some point, that day will come,

19:20.400 --> 19:22.150
because they are always together.

19:22.980 --> 19:25.360
The wind, the waves, the clouds and the trees…

19:25.360 --> 19:34.540
If two hearts are connected, I know I’ll be able to see your sweet smile again someday.

19:37.590 --> 19:39.100
It’s mysterious,

19:39.100 --> 19:43.070
but when I listen to this song, somehow, it seems like things will be all right.

19:44.680 --> 19:48.370
When the things between Miyamori and I are cleared up,

19:49.650 --> 19:53.060
I know I’ll be able to see her smile again.

19:59.150 --> 20:01.400
I’m despicable.

20:03.280 --> 20:08.050
Marin and Kojima… I like them both, and yet…

20:08.600 --> 20:11.700
I’ve never said it once before.

20:19.720 --> 20:22.790
Where did she go?

20:22.790 --> 20:25.780
Maybe she is about to get here.

20:28.000 --> 20:31.250
I’m sure everyone will be all right.

20:32.240 --> 20:36.920
I’ll definitely be able to retrieve everyone’s smiles.

20:38.930 --> 20:40.050
Marin!

20:40.510 --> 20:41.590
Kojima!

20:41.590 --> 20:44.130
Kanon-chan, welcome back.

20:44.130 --> 20:46.300
Miyamori… Miyamori!

20:46.300 --> 20:48.190
About that, I…

20:48.190 --> 20:48.930
Wait!

20:50.040 --> 20:52.290
Why? I…

20:52.290 --> 20:52.980
That’s not it.

20:54.690 --> 20:58.980
Can’t I say it for myself?

20:59.700 --> 21:02.280
I… I…

21:04.500 --> 21:05.230
Kojima!

21:07.960 --> 21:10.030
No way! Why is this happening?

21:16.580 --> 21:19.930
Our powers are back, Kanon-chan.

21:19.930 --> 21:22.340
With them, we’ll protect everyone.

21:24.700 --> 21:27.090
I won’t be confused anymore.

21:27.650 --> 21:30.430
Marin, let’s combine our powers.

21:36.040 --> 21:39.240
The Priestess of the Sky, having a heart of light…

21:39.240 --> 21:44.320
Is detestable. Hurry up and revert back to a heart of darkness.

21:44.320 --> 21:45.570
Stop kidding around!

21:45.980 --> 21:47.860
Let go of Kojima-san!

21:49.590 --> 21:52.040
I wonder what will happen if we kill this guy.

21:52.440 --> 21:56.160
Let’s see. She might revert back to a heart of darkness.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.260
Kojima!

21:59.260 --> 22:00.290
Stop it!

22:03.640 --> 22:12.560
That’s right. Priestess of the Sky, who stole what is precious to me… If I don’t make her taste the same pain…

22:26.950 --> 22:31.870
hikari no yurikago

22:26.950 --> 22:31.870
Within a droplet of water,

22:32.280 --> 22:35.410
shizuku no naka ni

22:32.280 --> 22:35.410
a cradle of light

22:35.750 --> 22:38.670
tojikometara

22:35.750 --> 22:38.670
is trapped.

22:38.670 --> 22:43.840
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.670 --> 22:43.840
And so, it colors the water.

22:44.250 --> 22:47.470
mimi wo sumashite

22:44.250 --> 22:47.470
Clear your ears

22:47.470 --> 22:50.130
eien e

22:47.470 --> 22:50.050
to eternity.

22:50.130 --> 22:55.430
hitori de yume no ato

22:50.220 --> 22:55.430
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.430 --> 23:00.770
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.430 --> 23:00.770
if one connects with another,

23:01.480 --> 23:07.360
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.480 --> 23:07.360
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.780 --> 23:12.410
warattemo attete

23:07.780 --> 23:12.410
meets and smiles,

23:12.410 --> 23:19.580
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:12.410 --> 23:19.580
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.580 --> 23:24.290
toumeina inori de

23:19.580 --> 23:24.170
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.290 --> 23:33.640
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:24.290 --> 23:33.640
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.780 --> 23:38.360
Did you know? Sea cucumbers melt when you rub them on!

23:38.360 --> 23:39.930
Melt away!

23:39.930 --> 23:42.030
Rub, rub, rub, rub…

23:42.030 --> 23:43.270
Breasts can’t be melted.

23:44.130 --> 23:45.920
Next time, episode 10:

23:45.920 --> 23:47.470
The Silent Heart.

23:47.480 --> 23:49.860
I love everyone!
